          <p>Post-2000 rebuilds across L5. Modern plastic push-fit plumbing, new boilers, mains pressure systems. Push-fit joints can fail at the connection if disturbed. We carry the common fittings on the van.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>Modern Apartment Blocks</h3>
          <p>Element the Quarter and the newer blocks around Vauxhall and the city centre edge. Communal hot water risers. Concierge access to plant rooms. We coordinate with building management.</p>
