        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>New-Build Push-Fit Joint Leaks</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>The new-build estates across L5 use plastic push-fit plumbing. The joints can pop if installed badly or knocked during other work. A failed joint releases water fast. We carry the common push-fit fittings and rework the connection.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/leak-detection-liverpool">Leak detection →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>HMO Boiler Breakdowns</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>An HMO with five or six tenants and one boiler. When it fails everyone loses heat and hot water. We prioritise HMO calls. Written paperwork ready for the landlord's insurance claim.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/boiler-repair-liverpool">Boiler repair →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>CP12 Selective Licensing Paperwork</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">Same-day available</span></div>
          <p>Everton selective licensing inspections require valid CP12 gas safety paperwork. We do these from £100 per property. Same-day if needed. Batch pricing for landlords with several L5 rentals.</p>
          <a class="job-link" href="/gas-safety-certificate-liverpool">Gas safety certificates →</a>
